#: data/io.github.schotek.Malachi.metainfo.xml.in:11
msgid ""
"Malachi Mail is a desktop email client for Linux, built with GTK 4 and "
"libadwaita. It keeps mail available offline, renders HTML messages only "
"after sanitising them, and separates the user interface from the mail engine "
"so that the engine can be reused."
